  "summary_en": "Japan's Ministerial Ordinance implementing the Road Traffic Act and its Cabinet Order. A comprehensive road-traffic rulebook covering vehicle classes, licensing and driving schools. Embodied-AI-relevant parts include standards for remotely operated small vehicles (delivery robots), emergency stops, notification, and the Chapter 2-7 permit scheme for specified automated operation (Level 4).",
